OL,3,GNEWSAWork to bring historic buildings
OL,4,Aback into use
OL,5,
OL,6,FHistoric buildings in the heart of a
OL,7,Fconservation area are due to be brought
OL,8,Fback into use as part of a planned film
OL,9,Fvillage.
OL,11,FThe properties on Church Street in
OL,12,FHartlepool were in need of
OL,13,F"significant" structural repairs and
OL,14,Fhad been vacant for many years,
OL,15,FHartlepool Borough Council said.
OL,17,FThe authority said it had secured
OL,18,F#910,000 funding from Historic England
OL,19,Ffor structures that were at risk of
OL,20,Fdecaying.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
